  "lore": {
    "description": "A sixteen legged amphibious creature with a long, segmented body, the Newtapede was generated on Poseidas among the aquatic, water-breathing Xalians capable of surviving in its rising and acidifying oceans. While adapted to land, its slender frame and webbed feet make it a formidable opponent in water. The rigs of Poseidas were built deeper and deeper beneath the ocean to avoid the storms, and the Newtapede lives in the water around them.",
